{"id":"db91b1b0197ed826","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-order-tukey-order-filter.md","title":"ZFC Order Tukey Order Filter","display":"df-zfc-order-tukey-order-filter — ZFC Order Tukey Order Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order-tukey-order-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order-tukey-order-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-order-tukey-order-filter — ZFC Order Tukey Order Filter","depends_on":["[[58-df-filter-set]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order-tukey-order-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order-tukey-order-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order-tukey-order-filter — ZFC Order Tukey Order Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"58-df-filter-set\">58-df-filter-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c9b9175a5a31065e\" href=\"?note=c9b9175a5a31065e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order\">58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G,X,Y\\in V\">\\(F,G,X,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"58-df-filter-set\">58-df-filter-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrderTukeyOrderFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrderTukeyOrderFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}order\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrderTukeyOrderFilter}_S(F,G,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,Y)\\land\\exists\\varphi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,G,F)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq G\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(C,G,\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in G\\times G:B\\subseteq A\\})\\to\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(\\varphi[C],F,\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in F\\times F:B\\subseteq A\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}order\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrderTukeyOrderFilter}_S(F,G,X,Y) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,X)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,Y)\\land\\exists\\varphi\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,G,F)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq G\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(C,G,\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in G\\times G:B\\subseteq A\\})\\to\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11CofinalSubsetOrder}_S(\\varphi[C],F,\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in F\\times F:B\\subseteq A\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Convention: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\leq_TG\">\\(F\\leq_TG\\)</span> is witnessed by a cofinal map from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,\\supseteq)\">\\((G,\\supseteq)\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,\\supseteq)\">\\((F,\\supseteq)\\)</span>; both reverse-inclusion orders are restricted to their stated carriers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-filter-set","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order","status":"resolved","id":"c9b9175a5a31065e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-order11-cofinal-subset-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter-set","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-filter-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,G,X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcO